WEBVTT

00:07.720 --> 00:16.200
Second Brother... I trust you have been well?

00:17.400 --> 00:18.800
Greetings, Eldest Brother.

00:27.160 --> 00:33.000
Second Brother... since when did we two reach a point where we have nothing left to say to one another?

00:32.840 --> 00:34.200
Eldest Brother...

00:36.440 --> 00:43.800
Yu Gong was my mentor and friend; you are my elder brother. Losing either tears my heart in two.

00:44.880 --> 00:53.600
I believed that between blood brothers, even if our bones broke the sinews would remain bound. It never should have come to this... Wouldn't you agree, Eldest Brother?

00:56.720 --> 01:02.200
Xie Jian'an and Chu Huan are both paramount minds of our generation.

01:02.640 --> 01:09.800
Having them at your command was not enough—you still needed that Yu Gong to win the hearts of the common folk for you!

01:07.480 --> 01:10.500
Just what are you plotting, little brother?
